A typed div's directive classes lead its attributes

```
{k=v .c}
::: note
x
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note c" k="v" aria-label="Note">
  <p>x</p>
</aside>
```

```
{k=v .c}
::: foo
x
:::
.
<div class="foo c" k="v">
  <p>x</p>
</div>
```

```
{k=v}
::: foo
x
:::
.
<div class="foo" k="v">
  <p>x</p>
</div>
```

```
{k=v .foo .c}
::: foo
x
:::
.
<div class="foo c" k="v">
  <p>x</p>
</div>
```
